<title>THAILAND: TCJ Motor '96 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>TCJ Motor '96 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reviewed financial results for for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 8.61			8.57</p>
<p>    Net			215.30		    183.21</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is TCJ Motor Plc, an operator of heavy machine equipment.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
